^CONVERSION ERROR$
inaccessible copy assignment operator
--
N5008 [class.copy.assign]/7: the implicit copy assignment operator of a class
whose direct base deletes its own is defined as deleted, so a
requires-expression using it is not satisfied ([expr.prim.req.general]/5).
libstdc++ 11's assignable_from<pair<const K, V> &, ...> (cpp20_map_basic on
GCC 11) failed to define it instead.
